A '''Null Sphere''' is a {{Uncommon}} item. It is an {{O|G}} drop used to craft many items related to [[Enderman Slayer]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Voidgloom Seraph ===
'''Null Spheres''' are {{O|G}} drops from all tiers of the {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph}}. The amount dropped varies based on the tier of the boss.

* {{Stier|1}}: 2-3x
* {{Stier|2}}: 14-24x
* {{Stier|3}}: 60-80x
* {{Stier|4}}: 105-155x

